00:02:10.140 --> 00:02:12.300
I, I see some of the like, uh,

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:14.910
baseline of feature functions, um,

00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:16.785
that were in the assignment originally,

00:02:16.785 --> 00:02:19.010
